    "### accuracy_score()\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose**: Calculate the accuracy of predictions.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Syntax**: `accuracy_score(y_true, y_pred)`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Parameters**:\n",
    "- `y_true`: True labels\n",
    "- `y_pred`: Predicted labels\n",
    "\n",
    "**Return value**: Accuracy score (0.0 to 1.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why it is appropriate here**: Accuracy provides a simple overall measure of correctness, useful for general performance assessment."
   ]
