    "**Purpose**: Calculate F1-score (harmonic mean of precision and recall).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Syntax**: `f1_score(y_true, y_pred)`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Parameters**:\n",
    "- `y_true`: True labels\n",
    "- `y_pred`: Predicted labels\n",
    "\n",
    "**Return value**: F1-score (0.0 to 1.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why it is appropriate here**: F1-score balances precision and recall, providing a single metric when both are important. It's particularly useful when classes are imbalanced."
